                                "example_id": "ff0a4532-d65d-4493-aa6e-4d48bc34e18f",
                                "sense_id": "3c2a2332-abc9-3230-8461-2470104cb17b",
                                "text": "The notion of retaining empirics may seem paradoxical when the tenets of holism and the requirements of empirics are scrutinized."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "635ed172-2b81-42fa-a88d-4861cefb50a8",
                                "sense_id": "3c2a2332-abc9-3230-8461-2470104cb17b",
                                "text": "At one time, this might have been rationalized by the paucity of empirics in the field or its weak theoretical foundations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfd7c960-166a-4e35-9676-b5a0cfec7363",
                                "sense_id": "3c2a2332-abc9-3230-8461-2470104cb17b",
                                "text": "This does not suggest that these determinants are not important in the growth empirics, but that they have a less important role than the ones we identify as \"strongly\" robust."
                            }
